docs {
  # Assign Mentor to ASH Student

  Assigns a mentor to an ASH student record. On success, all related cache entries (single record and paginated lists) are invalidated.

  ## Authorization
  Requires `update` permission.

  ## Path Parameters

  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Description                          |
  |-----------|--------|----------|--------------------------------------|
  | id        | string | Yes      | UUID of the ASH student record       |

  ## Request Body (`application/json`)

  | Field  | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values        |
  |--------|--------|----------|-------------------------------------|
  | mentor | string | Yes      | Mentor's name (minimum 3 characters)|

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`** — Returns the updated student record with `id`, `status`, and `assignedMentor` fields.

  ## Errors

  | Status                      | Description                                             |
  |-----------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid `id` format or `mentor` too short.              |
  | `401 Unauthorized`          | Missing or invalid authentication token.                |
  | `403 Forbidden`             | User does not have `update` permission.                 |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                                |
}
